{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0795"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/design","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__design.json","changes":[{"field":"titleEn","old":"Five Logos and the Artists Who Drew Them","new":"Logos, Covers and the Artists Who Drew Them"},{"field":"titleDe","old":"Fünf Logos und die Künstler, die sie zeichneten","new":"Logos, Cover und die Künstler, die sie zeichneten"},{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",112],["+","pop artist, a "],["=",10],["-","two"],["+","several"],["=",5],["-","several"],["+","a"],["=",1],["+","few "],["=",20],["-","the"],["+","them"],["=",1],["-","five "],["=",152],["+","of the Chupa Chups logo "],["=",181],["+"," The album's front cover came from a far more famous artist: Andy Warhol photographed a man's jeans in close-up and had a real metal zipper set into the sleeve, which could be pulled down to reveal underwear beneath."],["=",135],["-","Also"],["+","That"],["=",1],["-","in"],["+","same"],["=",1],["-","1971,"],["+","year"],["=",79],["-","The"],["+","Another"],["=",1],["-","last"],["+","mark"],["=",1],["-","of the five "],["=",132],["-","state"],["+","state.\n\nSome"],["=",1],["-","and"],["+","logos"],["=",1],["-","copied"],["+","carry"],["=",1],["-","on"],["+","a"],["=",1],["-","T-shirts"],["+","message"],["=",1],["-","around"],["+","rather"],["=",1],["+","than a brand. Amnesty International, founded in London in 1961 by "],["=",2],["-","world."],["+","lawyer Peter Benenson, chose a candle wrapped in barbed wire, drawn by Diana Redhouse: the light of hope burning inside the prison fence, after the proverb \"better to light a candle than to curse the darkness\"."],["=",5],["+","or cover "],["=",14],["+","Amnesty candle | Diana Redhouse | 1960s |\n| "],["=",40],["+","Sticky Fingers zipper cover | Andy Warhol | 1971 |\n| "],["=",54],["-","Five"],["+","Very"],["=",1],["-","marks, five very "],["=",14],["-","logos"],["+","marks"],["=",24]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",94],["+","einem Pop-Art-Künstler, "],["=",10],["-","zwei"],["+","mehreren"],["=",5],["-","mehrere"],["+","einige"],["=",15],["-","der fünf "],["=",142],["-","Design"],["+","Logo"],["=",1],["+","von Chupa Chups "],["=",161],["+"," Das Frontcover des Albums stammte von einem weit berühmteren Künstler: Andy Warhol fotografierte eine Männerjeans in Nahaufnahme und ließ einen echten Reißverschluss aus Metall in die Hülle einsetzen, den man herunterziehen konnte, um die Unterwäsche darunter zu sehen."],["=",127],["-","Ebenfalls"],["+","Im"],["=",1],["-","1971"],["+","selben"],["=",1],["+","Jahr "],["=",66],["-","Das"],["+","Ein"],["=",1],["-","letzte"],["+","weiteres"],["=",1],["-","der"],["+","Zeichen"],["=",1],["-","fünf"],["+","entstand"],["=",1],["-","wurde "],["=",8],["-","Taxis"],["+","Taxis."],["=",1],["-","gezeichnet. "],["=",102],["-","Bundesstaat"],["+","Bundesstaat.\n\nManche"],["=",1],["-","und"],["+","Logos"],["=",1],["-","wird"],["+","tragen"],["=",1],["-","auf"],["+","eine"],["=",1],["-","T-Shirts"],["+","Botschaft"],["=",1],["+","statt einer Marke. Amnesty International, 1961 "],["=",2],["-","aller"],["+","London"],["=",1],["-","Welt"],["+","vom"],["=",1],["-","kopiert."],["+","Anwalt Peter Benenson gegründet, wählte eine von Stacheldraht umwickelte Kerze, gezeichnet von Diana Redhouse: das Licht der Hoffnung, das hinter dem Gefängniszaun brennt, nach dem Sprichwort „Besser eine Kerze anzünden, als über die Dunkelheit zu klagen“."],["=",5],["+","oder Cover "],["=",14],["+","Amnesty-Kerze | Diana Redhouse | 1960er |\n| "],["=",32],["+","Reißverschluss-Cover von Sticky Fingers | Andy Warhol | 1971 |\n| "],["=",50],["-","Fünf"],["+","Sehr"],["=",1],["-","Zeichen, fünf sehr "],["=",14],["-","Logos"],["+","Zeichen"],["=",26]]}]},
